{
  "judges.16.p1.b1": {
    "text": "サムソンはガザへ行って、そこでひとりの遊女を見、その女のところにはいった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p1.b2": {
    "text": "サムソンがここにきた",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p1.b3": {
    "text": "ガザの人々はその所を取り囲み、夜通し町の門で待ち伏せし、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p1.b4": {
    "text": "われわれは朝まで待って彼を殺そう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p2.b1": {
    "text": "サムソンは夜中まで寝たが、夜中に起きて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p2.b2": {
    "text": "町の門のとびらと二つの門柱に手をかけて、貫の木もろともに引き抜き、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p2.b3": {
    "text": "肩に載せて、ヘブロンの向かいにある山の頂に運んで行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p3.b1": {
    "text": "この後、サムソンはソレクの谷にいるデリラという女を愛した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p3.b2": {
    "text": "あなたはサムソンを説きすすめて、彼の大力はどこにあるのか、またわれわれはどうすれば彼に勝って、彼を縛り苦しめることができるかを見つけなさい。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p3.b3": {
    "text": "そうすればわれわれはおのおの銀千百枚ずつをあなたにさしあげましょう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p4.b1": {
    "text": "あなたの大力はどこにあるのか、またどうすればあなたを縛って苦しめることができるか、どうぞわたしに聞かせてください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p4.b2": {
    "text": "人々がもし、かわいたことのない七本の新しい弓弦をもってわたしを縛るなら、わたしは弱くなってほかの人のようになるでしょう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p4.b3": {
    "text": "女はそれをもってサムソンを縛った。 女はかねて奥のへやに人を忍ばせておいて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:8-9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p4.b4": {
    "text": "サムソンよ、ペリシテびとがあなたに迫っています",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p4.b5": {
    "text": "しかしサムソンはその弓弦を、あたかも亜麻糸が火にあって断たれるように断ち切った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p5.b1": {
    "text": "あなたはわたしを欺いて、うそを言いました。どうしたらあなたを縛ることができるか、どうぞ今わたしに聞かせてください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p5.b2": {
    "text": "もし人々がまだ用いたことのない新しい綱をもって、わたしを縛るなら、弱くなってほかの人のようになるでしょう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p5.b3": {
    "text": "サムソンはその綱を糸のように腕から断ち落した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p5.b4": {
    "text": "あなたがもし、わたしの髪の毛七ふさを機の縦糸と一緒に織って、くぎでそれを留めておくならば、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p5.b5": {
    "text": "サムソンよ、ペリシテびとがあなたに迫っています",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p5.b6": {
    "text": "くぎと機と縦糸とを引き抜いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p6.b1": {
    "text": "あなたの心がわたしを離れているのに、どうして『おまえを愛する』と言うことができますか。あなたはすでに三度もわたしを欺き、…",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p6.b2": {
    "text": "女は毎日その言葉をもって彼に迫り促したので、彼の魂は死ぬばかりに苦しんだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p6.b3": {
    "text": "わたしの頭にはかみそりを当てたことがありません。わたしは生れた時から神にささげられたナジルびとだからです。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p6.b4": {
    "text": "もし髪をそり落されたなら、わたしの力は去って…",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p7.b1": {
    "text": "サムソンはその心をことごとくわたしに打ち明けましたから、今度こそ上っておいでなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p7.b2": {
    "text": "そこでペリシテびとの君たちは、銀を携えて女のもとに上ってきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p7.b3": {
    "text": "女は自分のひざの上にサムソンを眠らせ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p7.b4": {
    "text": "人を呼んで髪の毛、七ふさをそり落させ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p7.b5": {
    "text": "彼を苦しめ始めたが、その力は彼を去っていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p8.b1": {
    "text": "サムソンよ、ペリシテびとがあなたに迫っています",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p8.b2": {
    "text": "わたしはいつものように出て行って、からだをゆすろう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p8.b3": {
    "text": "彼は主が自分を去られたことを知らなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p8.b4": {
    "text": "そこでペリシテびとは彼を捕えて、…ガザに引いて行って、青銅の足かせをかけて彼をつないだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p9.b1": {
    "text": "両眼をえぐり、…こうしてサムソンは獄屋の中で、うすをひいていたが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p9.b2": {
    "text": "その髪の毛はそり落された後、ふたたび伸び始めた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p10.b1": {
    "text": "さてペリシテびとの君たちは、彼らの神ダゴンに大いなる犠牲をささげて祝をしようと、共に集まって言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p10.b2": {
    "text": "われわれの神は、敵サムソンをわれわれの手にわたされた",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p10.b3": {
    "text": "サムソンを呼んで、われわれのために戯れ事をさせよう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p10.b4": {
    "text": "彼らは獄屋からサムソンを呼び出して、彼らの前に戯れ事をさせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p11.b1": {
    "text": "わたしの手を放して、この家をささえている柱をさぐらせ、それに寄りかからせてください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p11.b2": {
    "text": "また屋根の上には三千人ばかりの男女がいて、サムソンの戯れ事をするのを見ていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p11.b3": {
    "text": "ああ、主なる神よ、どうぞ、わたしを覚えてください。ああ、神よ、どうぞもう一度、わたしを強くして、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p11.b4": {
    "text": "そしてサムソンは、その家をささえている二つの中柱の一つを右の手に、一つを左の手にかかえて、身をそれに寄せ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p12.b1": {
    "text": "わたしはペリシテびとと共に死のう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p12.b2": {
    "text": "力をこめて身をかがめると、家はその中にいた君たちと、すべての民の上に倒れた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.16.p12.b3": {
    "text": "彼を引き取り、携え上って、ゾラとエシタオルの間にある父マノアの墓に葬った。サムソンがイスラエルをさばいたのは二十年であった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 16:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
